  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed new dwelling by reason of its design, scale, siting and layout, would result in a cramped and incongruous form of development that would fail to respect the proportions of the original house and the established character, appearance and spatial pattern of the surrounding area. It would fail to comply with Local Plan policies SC1, SC7, CC1 and CC2  and the intentions of the Residential Extension Guidelines SPD. ",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal would fail to provide minimum standard of accommodation within its external spaces to both the existing and proposed dwellings, and would fail to comply with London Plan policy D6 and Local Plan policy SC5.",
    "Reason : 3 - In the absence of sufficient biodiversity details, the applicant has failed to demonstrate that the scheme complies with Local Plan policy GB7 and Schedule 7A of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as introduced by the Environmental Act 2021).  ",
    "Reason : 4 - In the absence of sufficient details, the applicant has failed to demonstrate that adequate and safe access and transport provisions would be provided to both the existing and new dwellings at this application site. It would fail to comply with London Plan policy T6.1 and Local Plan policy EC2 and the Council's Residential Crossovers and Off-street Parking Policy. "
  ],
